+# THE TRIAL'S MODEL PROFILES (plan step 3.2): one per page reader and
+# compression level, appended to support/scheduler/profiles.toml by the
+# integrator (the trial's fence does not reach that file; the merge request
+# carries the patch). Weights are absolute paths on the second hard disk
+# (/mnt/hdd2/qv4-models, step 3.1); `page-reader` in profiles.toml already
+# serves the incumbent GLM-OCR Q8_0 from the models folder.
+#
+# memory_gb is null until a swap measures it (rule 9; the run fills it).
+# Every reader: one slot (a page image is the whole request), temperature 0,
+# 32k context per request. The Qwen 3.5 bases think unless told not to, so
+# their profiles carry the same template flag the text reader does.
+
+[profiles.trial-glm-ocr-f16]
